{"seq":1,"slug":"delivery-models","title":"末端配送模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/last-mile-delivery/delivery-models","wordCount":1067,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"末端配送模式\">末端配送模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>末端配送（Last-Mile Delivery）是物流链路的最后一环，也是成本最高、体验最敏感的环节。&quot;最后一公里&quot;占整体物流成本的 40-50%，因为它涉及大量分散的配送点、复杂的城市交通和个性化的时间窗口。配送模式的选择直接影响用户满意度和平台的单位经济模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[分拨中心] --&gt; B{配送模式}&#10;    B --&gt; C[自有配送员]&#10;    B --&gt; D[众包配送]&#10;    B --&gt; E[快递公司]&#10;    B --&gt; F[自提/驿站]&#10;    C --&gt; G[上门配送]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; H[消费者自取]&#10;    G --&gt; I[签收确认]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TB\n    A[分拨中心] --&gt; B{配送模式}\n    B --&gt; C[自有配送员]\n    B --&gt; D[众包配送]\n    B --&gt; E[快递公司]\n    B --&gt; F[自提/驿站]\n    C --&gt; G[上门配送]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; H[消费者自取]\n    G --&gt; I[签收确认]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配送模式</th>\n<th>时效</th>\n<th>成本/单</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>控制力</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自有配送</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>¥5-12</td>\n<td>中（城区）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>即时/生鲜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>众包配送</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>¥3-8</td>\n<td>广</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>外卖/闪送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快递公司</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>¥3-6</td>\n<td>最广</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>标准电商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驿站/自提柜</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>¥1-3</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>包裹存放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无人配送</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>¥2-5</td>\n<td>窄（试点）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>封闭园区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自有配送与众包配送\">自有配送与众包配送</h2><p>自有配送（In-House Delivery）由平台雇佣全职配送员，按照统一的服务标准执行配送。京东快递、顺丰的配送员身着统一制服、遵循标准操作流程，提供一致的服务体验。自有配送的优势是服务可控、品牌一致，劣势是人力成本固定、弹性差。</p>\n<p>众包配送（Crowdsourced Delivery）通过灵活用工平台招募兼职配送员，按单计费。达达、闪送、UberEats 的骑手就是典型的众包配送。众包模式在高峰时段可以快速扩展运力，低峰时段不产生固定成本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DeliveryFleetConfig {&#10;  type: &#39;in_house&#39; | &#39;crowdsourced&#39; | &#39;hybrid&#39;;&#10;  inHouseFleet?: {&#10;    totalDrivers: number;&#10;    vehicleTypes: (&#39;bike&#39; | &#39;scooter&#39; | &#39;van&#39; | &#39;truck&#39;)[];&#10;    shifts: {&#10;      morning: { start: string; end: string; headcount: number };&#10;      afternoon: { start: string; end: string; headcount: number };&#10;      evening: { start: string; end: string; headcount: number };&#10;    };&#10;    compensation: {&#10;      baseSalary: number;&#10;      perOrderBonus: number;&#10;      peakMultiplier: number;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  crowdsourced?: {&#10;    platform: string;&#10;    averageOnlineDrivers: number;&#10;    peakCapacity: number;&#10;    perOrderFee: number;&#10;    surgeConfig: {&#10;      threshold: number;&#10;      maxMultiplier: number;&#10;    };&#10;    qualityControl: {&#10;      ratingThreshold: number;&#10;      completionRateMin: number;&#10;      backgroundCheck: boolean;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeliveryFleetConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_house'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'crowdsourced'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hybrid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  inHouseFleet</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    totalDrivers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    vehicleTypes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bike'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'scooter'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'van'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'truck'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    shifts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      morning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headcount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      afternoon</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headcount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      evening</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headcount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    compensation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      baseSalary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      perOrderBonus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      peakMultiplier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  crowdsourced</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    platform</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    averageOnlineDrivers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    peakCapacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    perOrderFee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    surgeConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      maxMultiplier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    qualityControl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      ratingThreshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      completionRateMin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      backgroundCheck</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>自有配送</th>\n<th>众包配送</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>服务一致性</td>\n<td>高（标准化培训）</td>\n<td>中（质量波动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本结构</td>\n<td>固定为主</td>\n<td>变动为主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹性</td>\n<td>低（扩容慢）</td>\n<td>高（按需调度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌形象</td>\n<td>强（统一着装）</td>\n<td>弱（个人形象）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管理复杂度</td>\n<td>高（HR/合规）</td>\n<td>中（平台管理）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"驿站与自提柜\">驿站与自提柜</h2><p>驿站（Pickup Station）和智能自提柜（Parcel Locker）是缓解末端配送压力的重要基础设施。消费者在不方便收快递时，包裹被投递到附近的驿站或自提柜，消费者凭取件码自助取件。</p>\n<p>菜鸟驿站覆盖超过 17 万个社区，丰巢智能柜覆盖超过 30 万组。这种模式将&quot;一对一送上门&quot;转变为&quot;多对一集中投递&quot;，配送员效率提升 3-5 倍，但牺牲了送货上门的便利性。用户对驿站的接受度存在争议——年轻上班族普遍接受，老年人和购买重物的用户更倾向送货上门。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PickupPointNetwork {&#10;  points: {&#10;    id: string;&#10;    type: &#39;station&#39; | &#39;locker&#39; | &#39;store&#39; | &#39;post_office&#39;;&#10;    location: { lat: number; lng: number; address: string };&#10;    capacity: {&#10;      dailyPackages: number;&#10;      lockerSlots?: { small: number; medium: number; large: number };&#10;    };&#10;    operatingHours: { open: string; close: string };&#10;    services: (&#39;pickup&#39; | &#39;return&#39; | &#39;send&#39;)[];&#10;    averagePickupTime: number;&#10;  }[];&#10;  coverage: {&#10;    radiusKm: number;&#10;    populationCovered: number;&#10;    penetrationRate: number;&#10;  };&#10;  userExperience: {&#10;    notificationMethod: (&#39;sms&#39; | &#39;app_push&#39; | &#39;wechat&#39;)[];&#10;    pickupDeadline: number;&#10;    overdueFee?: number;&#10;    returnToSenderPolicy: string;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PickupPointNetwork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  points</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><s